      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "הבטחים",
      "rationale": "בטח = beltarim (ranim shelta), i no 'trast' nating."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Luk, yu beltarim long stik bilong ken, dispela i bruk pinis, long Mitsrayim — we man i holim long em, na i go long han bilong em na hulim em — olsem Faro, king bilong Mitsrayim, i stap long olgeta we ol i beltarim long em.",
